              "content": "=Analyze this lead for potential interest in our product.\n\nName: {{$json.name}}\nCompany: {{$json.company}}\nJob title: {{$json.job_title}}\nLinkedIn: {{$json.linkedin_url}}\nEmail: {{$json.email}}\n\nGive a lead score from 1 to 100 and a short reason.\n\nReturn exactly in this format:\nLead Score: [number]\nReason: [short reason]"
